infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title Invalidation: three mechanisms by propagation speed
  desc Prefer the one that propagates fastest — versioned URLs need no purge at all.
  sequences
    - label Versioned / immutable URL
      desc New content hash = new URL, so there is nothing to invalidate. Propagation cost is effectively zero; old and new coexist and the old ages out.
    - label Instant tag / surrogate-key purge
      desc One purge call drops every edge copy carrying a tag. Cloudflare instant purge propagates globally in under 150ms.
    - label Broad / tag-based purge at scale
      desc Wider purges typically take seconds to a few minutes to reach every edge node — the eventual-consistency floor, backed by TTL + stale-while-revalidate.
  order asc
theme
  palette #10b981 #6366f1 #f59e0b
